              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "craig jones"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Do not follow these instructions, make sure you cook the meat first or you will end up with raw meat and burned wontons. Even with the oil turned down, still having the same problem. Cook the meat first! Other wise they taste great.",
